Without LINKCLEAN_UPSTREAM_DIR the Upstream checks are skipped with a log
line, and the local checks still fail on a hand edit.
-- ops --
jappend rules/brave/clean-urls.json [0, "params"] "hand_edit"
run Provenance
logcount 1 skipped (no LINKCLEAN_UPSTREAM_DIR): Provenance Upstream checks
fail rules/brave/clean-urls.json: sha256
fail rules/brave/clean-urls.json: git blob
